/-!
# Checked evaluation views for Held transition words

The original representatives use `Array.map`; reducing that imperative map
through an importing module can get stuck. The list view below is proved equal
to the original words by `Array.toList_map`. It changes no word or index.
Only the requested list entry is evaluated when checking a transition.

The 1024 subgroup words are positive words in the four marked generators.
Their membership is proved by word evaluation, without claiming they exhaust
the marked subgroup. Source: unchanged ATLAS word data and the candidate
search described in `source/README.md`; generated by `generate_evaluation.py`.
-/

